<P STYLE="text-align: right; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 8pt"><B>Exhibit 99.1</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><IMG SRC="image_001.jpg" ALT="Graphical user interface&#10;&#10;Description automatically generated with medium confidence" STYLE="height: 70px; width: 186px"></FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

